(Float-free whole-list printing - regression guard for the conditional
 assembly in list.asm. A program with no floats builds _list_print WITHOUT
 the float-tag branch (__FLOAT_ASM_INCLUDED__ undefined), yet must still
 render integer, text, boolean, mixed, and empty lists correctly. This
 is the configuration that broke when _list_print first referenced
 PRINT_FLOAT without float.asm being included.)

a list called nums is [1, 2, 3].
print nums.

a list called names is ["Alice", "Bob"].
print names.

a list called flags is [yes, no, yes].
print flags.

a list called mix is [1, "two", yes].
print mix.

a list called blank is [].
print blank.

print "nums: {nums}".